{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012mXUzjB1gvREEQbXior4iL","type":"tool_result","content":"ok src/mocap/mocap.js 20359\nok src/mocap/readable.js 28843\nok tools/anim-set.mjs 3121\nok src/mocap/sets/mesh2motion.js 818709\nok src/mocap/sets/cmu.js 722374\nok examples/cmu-lib/CMU_111.js 678789\nok examples/cmu-lib/CMU_113.js 521702\nok examples/cmu-lib/CMU_49.js 213788\n8: *   Mocap.drive(humanoid, lib)  then each step  humanoid.mocap = pose: the rig plays it at its own build. (Mocap is also\n10: *     humanoid.mocapW (0..1) fades it in and out over the rig's own animation; humanoid.mocapMask = 'upper' plays\n167: * Mocap.drive(rig, lib): after the rig poses itself each step it takes the pose in rig.mocap (a sampled pose, or\n171: * draws around the joints follows the clip's body and head (rig.mocapTilt: upside down in a cartwheel, a face that\n173: * rig.mocapW fades the clip over the rig's own pose; rig.mocapMask = 'upper' leaves the hips and legs to the rig.\n175:function drive(rig, lib) {\n182:    const pose = this.mocap, w = this.mocapW === undefined ? 1 : Math.max(0, Math.min(1, this.mocapW));\n184:    if (!pose || w <= 0) { this.mocapTilt = null; this.spin = this._ownSpin; return; }\n185:    const o = this.o, J = this.J, k = o.hipZ / hipH, upper = this.mocapMask === 'upper';\n241:    this.mocapTilt = body ? { body: frameMix(body, yaw - spin, w), head: frameMix(head, yaw - spin, w) } : null;\n243:    // the floor can do); the face, hair and toes it draws around the joints lie with the body through mocapTilt\n265:return { load, Mannequin, drive, LEGEND: MR.LEGEND };\n8:- **In a Claude Code cloud session:** put the zip in a private GitHub repository the session can add, or give a direct download link. A repository is the simplest channel for a 40–50 MB file. The Google Drive connector cannot carry files this large.\n37:- **The rest pose.** Each library's body is measured from its T-pose or `Rest Pose` clip, and `--rest` names